        "text": "May this political and geopolitical juncture go down in history as the time at which we decided to get back on our feet together, to rise up, and to allow Venezuela's rebirth."
      },
      {
        "id": "S125",
        "text": "On the 16th of December, we will mark 200 years since the anguished appeal of the father of our freedom, Simón Bolívar."
